## Why This Is Asked
Interview explores multi-tenant isolation, dynamic throttling, and geo-distributed fault tolerance in Azure. It probes practical use of Event Hubs, Databricks, Cosmos, API Management, Redis, and tracing.

## Key Concepts
- Per-tenant data isolation (RLS/tenant keys)
- Dynamic quotas (API Management + Redis)
- Global failover (cosmos multi-region, regional APIM)
- Observability with OpenTelemetry

## Code Example
